        "id": "a-deleted-skill-is-purged-only-after-its-grace",
        "statement": "A deletion sweep purges a Skill and its versions only once the Skill's deletion is older than the grace period; a sweep given a non-positive grace is refused and purges nothing.",
        "contexts": [
          "registry"
        ],
        "examples": [
          "A Skill deleted a moment ago survives a 30-day sweep and a sweep with zero grace is refused; one deleted 31 days ago with nothing depending on it is purged."
